cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this benchmark, please cite it as below. Problem statements and answers remain copyright of their respective competition organizers."
title: "Integration Bee Benchmark: 100 curated integration problems with official answers"
abstract: >-
  A 100-problem benchmark of integration problems from real integration bees (MIT Integration Bee
  2023/2024/2025 qualifying exams, UK University Integration Bee 2025/26 Round 1, and the
  University of Florida Integration Bee 2025 written exam). Every answer is taken from the
  competition's own official answer key; every statement was transcribed from the official paper
  and screened for consistency with its answer.
authors:
  - alias: "Integration Bee Benchmark contributors"
version: "1.0"
date-released: "2026-09-08"
license: CC-BY-4.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/orangeofcarl0-sys/integration-bee-benchmark"
keywords:
  - integration
  - benchmark
  - llm-evaluation
  - mathematics
  - integration bee
